  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>오랜만에 중2를 맡아서 수업 준비중 입니다.&nbsp; 물질의 특성 첫 시간의 성취수준이 <span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">[혼합물과 순물질의 차이를 이해하여 <strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">우리 주변에서 볼 수 있는 여러 물질들을 순물질과 혼합물로 구분할 수 있다</span></strong></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">.]라서 학습지를 만들다가 우리 주변의 물질 중에서 플라스틱과 유리, 고무를 어디에 넣어야 하는지 고민하다 글을 올립니다.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">플라스틱은 고분자화합물이라고 하니 순물질인것 같고,</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">유리는 규사, 탄산석회 등의 원료를 녹여서 만들었으므로 균일 혼합물인것 같고,</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">천연 고무는 파라고무나무에서 얻은 수액을 응고 시킨 것 으로&nbsp; 균일 혼합물인것 같습니다.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자료를 찾다보니 비결정성고체(가열하면 엿처럼 말랑말랑해지다가 액체로 변하는물질)의 예로 유리, 플라스틱, 고무는 녹는점이 일정하지 않아서 순물질이 아니라고 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 세 가지 물질이 정확히 순물질인지 혼합물인지 좀 알려주세요~<span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
